---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { team } from "../data/content";
---

<Base
  title="Meet the Team"
  description="The people behind Project Cognify are a small group of students who research, design, and build together and share every major decision along the way."
>
  <h1>Meet the Team</h1>

  <div class="members">
    {
      team.map((member) => (
        <article class="member">
          <div class="member__body">
            <p class="member__head">
              <span class="member__name">{member.name}</span>
              <span class="member__role">{member.role}</span>
              <span class="member__focus">{member.focus}</span>
            </p>
            {member.bio.map((para) => (
              <p class="member__bio">{para}</p>
            ))}
            <blockquote class="member__quote">“{member.quote}”</blockquote>
          </div>
        </article>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <section class="prose work">
    <h2>How We Work</h2>
    <p>
      We're three high schoolers into tech, games, and studying (or at least
      trying to). What started as one offhand observation turned into
      something bigger once we started actually digging into it: reading,
      arguing with each other about what the data meant, redoing surveys we
      messed up the first time.
    </p>
    <p>
      Nobody owns a single lane here. Jeremy leans engineering, Ryan leans
      outreach, Jonathan leans research and writing, but the big calls (what
      to build, what the survey should even ask, when to scrap an idea) get
      made as a group, usually after some back-and-forth.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="prose believe">
    <h2>What We Believe</h2>
    <p>
      We'd rather end up with a question we didn't expect than a confirmation
      of the one we started with. That's mostly what this project has been so
      far, and we're fine with that as long as it's actually leading somewhere
      useful for students.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .members {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3.5rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .member {
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .member__body {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .member__head {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
  }

  .member__name {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .member__role {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .member__focus {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .member__bio {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
  }

  .member__quote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--foreground);
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
  }

  .work {
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .believe {
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
</style>
